#!/bin/sh
set -e
echo "[XAG] Removing ios-ag..."
PLIST="/Library/LaunchDaemons/com.zmmo.iosag.plist"
[ -f "$PLIST" ] && launchctl unload "$PLIST" 2>/dev/null || \
    launchctl bootout system "$PLIST" 2>/dev/null || true

rm -f /var/mobile/Library/Preferences/com.zmmo.iosag.plist
rm -f /var/mobile/Library/Preferences/com.zmmo.gps.plist
rm -f /var/mobile/Library/CoreServices/MobileGestalt_Fake.plist

echo "[XAG] ios-ag removed"
exit 0
